Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1027-1028] Onigashima 36 - Brachiosnakeus.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.63,0:01:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Thunder Bagua...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:41.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I defended against it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:44.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yet, it was\Nnowhere near enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamabro!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go help "Gutless" out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.44,0:01:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you calling "Gutless"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:58.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go do the damn thing\Nalready, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:03.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Silence!\NI am fully aware of what I must do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you truly believe people\Ncan change so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fear not, Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apologies for leaving you earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.05,0:02:23.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, then!\NLet us stop Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Countin' on ya, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:37.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.99,0:02:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where the hell do you\Nthink you're going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lend me your strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:59.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:05.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will surely...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make haste, Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamabro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want to face him\Nin a duel, aye?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am going to diiie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mo...\NMomonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:16.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clutch the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clutch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragons can create clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Create?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are a dragon now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am... a dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I create...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:46.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know how!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take Momonosuke-sama and flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:09.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely come back to you,\Nmy retainers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:23.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragons do not merely fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.07,0:05:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and dash through the skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.49,0:05:29.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such are dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am flyiiing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These clouds are called...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Flame Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!\NLook!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is most unusual!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The island is starting to collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:07.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.57,0:06:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It cannot be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,losing strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Flame Clouds Kaido created\Nare becoming unstable,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they can no longer support\Nthe fracturing bedrock!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must hurry, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall not permit such a treacherous thing\Nto make its way to the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mustn't,\NMomonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.53,0:06:49.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I grew so that I could\Nstop this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.11,0:06:52.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cannot,\NMomonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:54.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is not the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we do not have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And lo!\NWe are very nearly at the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It will arrive\Nin less than five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:09.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With those colossal,\Ndraconic clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido is moving Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:20.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To push it back, you must create\Nmore powerful Flame Clouds than his!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have barely learned flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:32.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, I do not necessarily share\Nthe same powers as he!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:37.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is all in our hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:40.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The situation is more dire\Nthan we thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:44.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if it lands as Kaido plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:47.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there will be numerous\Ncasualties in the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the worst-case scenario...\NShould Kaido runs out of strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Flame Clouds will disappear,\Nsending Onigashima hurtling to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stored within Onigashima are\Nunfathomable quantities of weapons...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and gunpowder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima is practically\Na titanic bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:13.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it is much too close...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is not enough time for\Nthe citizenry to evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:19.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should the island come down,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:21.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,enemy and ally alike\Nwill meet a grisly fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!\NThen we must stop Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:34.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He already totters on the precipice,\Nbearing the world upon his shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis only he who can fell Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:43.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We mustn't burden him further\Nwith this development!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:48.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We shall weather this storm,\Nand with none the wiser!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hit the deck!\NKing-sama's totally flipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King the Wildfire...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:45.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He ain't an All-Star for nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:47.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's damn strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No surprise there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:51.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell's goin' on,\Nover on the Floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't just throw out random attacks!\NYou cut my butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better if it were your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:18.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter Zoro...\Ndamaged King-san's mask?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that would piss him off...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows what he looks like\Nunder that mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better steer clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three Sword Style:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:56.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imperial...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:10:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Archer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:01.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ultra Tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:17.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:19.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two-Sword Style:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:29.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clear Lance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Close one...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least use your\Ndamn sword to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't lettin' you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:58.21,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1504,303)}Castle Interior\NGuest Parlor
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you doubt me?\NThink I'm lying, perhaps!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:09.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is, another dragon that isn't Kaido\Nmade their appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This must be the Devil Fruit\NVegapunk created!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:17.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they appear to be\Nallied with Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:21.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's fine, isn't it?\NJust pirates trying to put each other out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"If by any chance Kaido loses...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the Land of Wano,\Na non-member state of the World Government,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:44.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've already\Ndispatched ships to Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seizing a country by force, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No better than\Npirates themselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are the odds\Nthat Kaido loses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:13:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the beginning, Kaido had 30,000 troops,\Nbut that shrank to 12,000...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:06.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(660,930)}Kaido's army
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:06.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1245,930)}Samurai army
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:05.28,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,90)}In contrast,\Nthe samurai army had a mere 5,400,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:06.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1695,183)}Initially:\N30,000\NVS\N5,400
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:06.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(225,183)}Now:\N12,000\NVS\N8,000
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:06.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,100)}but now they number 8,000...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is a fascinating battle,\NI'll admit...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:14.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't see\NKaido actually falling, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.05,0:13:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring Nico Robin in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:38.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rob Lucci...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:38.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(390,624)}World Government\NIntelligence Agency\NCipher Pol "Aigis" Zero
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Further failure\Nwill not be tolerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:47.82,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1593,225)}Castle Interior\N3rd Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:51.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You expect I would hand over\Na friend of mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:57.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Verse Humming:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nock Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:10.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How was I?\NWas I the slightest bit helpful?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, quite!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:15.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:18.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There she is!\NIt's Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nab her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:28.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My,\Nthey've sent the horde!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:31.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're quite\Nthe popular one, Robin-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:34.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a bother, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:41.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know how hard it is,\Nbeing the center of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Most reassuring, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:48.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Careful,\Nor I'll get carried away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:14:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:02.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,stronger clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis progressing\Nfaster than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The speed of its collapse...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:22.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall return to the Skull Dome,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to minimize the damage that may come\Nfrom the worst possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are countless explosives\Nin the giant armory beneath the dome...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that I must somehow\Ndispose of,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lest the worst comes to pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:39.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the damage caused is\Nmultiplied many times over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:16:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall leave this task to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:04.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!\NYou would leave me behind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am certain you can summon\NFlame Clouds more powerful than Kaido's!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:14.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn! Damn!\NDamn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:18.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I summon thee, Flame Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:25.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could he...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:28.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...leave me alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:31.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nay!\NNo more petty grousing, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do this!\NI know you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:39.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, I cannot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nay, nay!\NI must do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Create clouds, then clutch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I summon thee...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I summon thee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:17:01.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must do this,\Nelse many of my people will perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:10.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not let this island...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...this massive bomb, fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A huge wolf?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:42.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is in your hands now,\NMomonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I summon thee, Flame Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because it is you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:59.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dance with me some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flying Pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:04.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flying Pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a super machine gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:15.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't nobody gonna\Nstop my funk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:20.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My attacks won't stop comin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:33.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, show it to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa 66's combat suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:51.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were showin' off your combat suit\Nto King, weren't ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty damn sure\Nyou went invisible right then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Judge's\Nscientific smarts for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:59.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid ass loudmouth lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:06.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, I really am feeling off...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:09.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you to\Ndrop that damn name!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know squat about\Nwhat's going on in my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.73,0:19:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scratch that,\Nthey're not my family at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't wearing that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:25.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Light Roast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:35.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diable Jambe:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bien Cuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.27,0:19:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Gril Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No damage?!\NBut that was Sanji-san's kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'm I gonna do...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...about this dino's toughness?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:39.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty good kick,\Nfor plain ol' flesh 'n blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.27,0:20:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, how bout I show you\Nwhat an unmodified dino can really do...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show you the power of those that dominated the world\Nfor over a hundred million years!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puny humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.35,0:21:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:16.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The true power of the ancients!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cry! Scream!\NCower in fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brachiosnakeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brachiosnakeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:42.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hwuuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.40,0:22:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dropped your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.03,0:22:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's the kind of dino\Na brachiosaurus is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.36,0:22:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't say...\NDammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now you see the true power of the dinosaur,\Nking of the ancient world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.63,0:22:28.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody's ever gotten loose\Nfrom the Brachiocoilus!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.09,0:22:30.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sangoro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:37.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san's done for\Nif this keeps up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.14,0:22:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.73,0:22:48.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knew dinosaurs\Nwere this terrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.53,0:22:53.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even a master of\NConqueror's Haki...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:22:58.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...can prevent my pressure from\Nshattering their bones and crushing their organs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:01.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone caught in it\Nain't comin' back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Done so soon,\Nson of Judge?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:09.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you show me what\NGerma's got cookin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let ya go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:14.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I refuse...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.77,0:23:31.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check that out!\NWere I just any old brachiosaurus...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.36,0:23:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But... I'm a scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:42.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Torso-mounted super weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.25,0:23:47.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A genius idea\Nfor making use of the useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.30,0:23:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is call out their name,\Nand they'll come flyin' right at ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.43,0:23:54.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're the\NBrachio Launchers!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.31,0:23:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:01.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:04.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.60,0:24:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damned piece o' junk!\NDo it only when I shout it out like an attack...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.53,0:24:11.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like this: Brachio Launchers...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.54,0:24:23.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M-Man...\NI pack a helluva punch...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.83,0:24:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But! My constriction technique's decided things!\NThis fight's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.05,0:24:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are already... dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.55,0:24:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every bone in his body's\Ngot to be broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.52,0:24:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must administer\Nthe super restorative!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.86,0:24:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.74,0:25:00.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, my boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.04,0:25:05.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it definitely hurts,\Nbut I can move around like I usually do...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're scarin' me, Sanji...\NDid you turn into a zombie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.00,0:25:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.35,0:25:20.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's happening to my body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.81,0:25:28.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.94,0:25:32.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I've awakened the same\Nenhancements as them...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.53,0:25:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.45,0:25:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay focused!\NBehind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.20,0:25:40.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm back to myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.83,0:25:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya little runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.71,0:25:47.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.59,0:25:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.72,0:26:03.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.52,0:26:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...become a monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.44,0:26:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...like any of them!
